{
  "schema": 1,
  "name": "Ability practice: original scripted Manafeed drain and healing",
  "contract": "Manafeed drains a mana-using PvE creature in combat. At full health its real drain earns no practice; an injured caster then receives actual healing from several scripted ticks, all sharing one original-cast award. This qualifies the custom periodic dummy path, not general helper or pet attribution.",
  "timeout_ms": 90000,
